## 3. Causality Assessment
- **Temporal Relationship:** Positive (reaction occurred after drug initiation)  
- **Dechallenge:** Positive (symptoms improved after stopping drug)  
- **Alternative Causes:** None significant  
- **Rechallenge:** Not performed (avoided for ethical reasons)  
- **Classification:** **Probable** — strong temporal link and dechallenge support causality, but absence of rechallenge prevents “Certain.”  

